OL,3,APowerful earthquake hits Tibet, killing
OL,4,A16 people, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe centre of the quake hit Baqen
OL,7,FCounty in the Nagqu region on Thursday
OL,8,Fnight, Xinhua reported, citing the
OL,9,Flocal emergency management bureau
OL,11,FThe county is 400km north-east of
OL,12,FTibet's capital, Lhasa
OL,14,FMore than 300 homes have reportedly
OL,15,Fcollapsed and power has largely been
OL,16,Fcut off to the region
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
